{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/4719e6ed9f95e55e31c78b4fe2aff7fb.poster.avif?t=1767293949\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/4719e6ed9f95e55e31c78b4fe2aff7fb.webm?t=1767293949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Happy Hour</strong> <br><i>\u201cStep into Chaos\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven adventure where every conversation can turn into chaos, laughter, or desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/c9abba1b5a7b991bdb4b1811023e5ae2.poster.avif?t=1767293949\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/c9abba1b5a7b991bdb4b1811023e5ae2.webm?t=1767293949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/c9abba1b5a7b991bdb4b1811023e5ae2.mp4?t=1767293949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters and Interactions</strong><br><i>\u201cMeet, Talk, and Stir Things Up\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re surrounded by colorful personalities full of secrets, pasts, and unique traits. Chat, gossip, flirt, or lend a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/60b42fd719f7b837bc25bf87ff2b6037.poster.avif?t=1767293949\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/60b42fd719f7b837bc25bf87ff2b6037.webm?t=1767293949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/60b42fd719f7b837bc25bf87ff2b6037.mp4?t=1767293949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests and Charm</strong> <br><i>\u201cDive into Drama\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on tasks, unravel the tangled web of relationships. Explore jealousy, gossip, and attraction. Forge intimate and fiery connections, and catch the night\u2019s hottest opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/e5b06da9806bd90eb33c2948b8870a54.poster.avif?t=1767293949\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/e5b06da9806bd90eb33c2948b8870a54.webm?t=1767293949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/e5b06da9806bd90eb33c2948b8870a54.mp4?t=1767293949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the Night</strong> <br><i>\u201cYour Choices Shape the Night\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different paths, complete tasks, and manage your interactions. Your decisions directly affect how the night unfolds and the surprises that appear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ NPC characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 10 quests per character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of dialogue options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and interactive items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078340?t=1767293949","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/1c57ba3a0e03c358f6f2a5bd812ae819cce2d5cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767293949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/0806a2485a66deae422da652f24931033faa79fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767293949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/0806a2485a66deae422da652f24931033faa79fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767293949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game may contain sexual innuendo, nudity, or adult-oriented scenes.\r\nThe humor is aimed at adults and may include sexual jokes, slang, or inappropriate comedy.\r\nCharacters may use profanity or strong language.\r\nAlcohol consumption or alcohol-related scenes are present."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078340/extras/4719e6ed9f95e55e31c78b4fe2aff7fb.poster.avif?t=1767293949\" width